    ("March 12", "Gregory the Great", PA, "Bishop of Rome (c. 540-604) who sent Augustine to England, wrote on pastoral care and called himself 'servant of the servants of God'. Lutherans and Anglicans honour him as a model pastor.", "Pastors, musicians, teachers"),
