    ("April 19", "Philipp Melanchthon's Death and Olaus Petri", P, "Philipp Melanchthon died on April 19, 1560, and the Swedish reformers Olaus Petri (1493-1552) and his brother Laurentius Petri (1499-1573) are remembered for giving Sweden its Bible and church order.", "Reformers, translators"),
    ("April 20", "Johannes Bugenhagen", P, "German pastor and reformer (1485-1558), Luther's pastor at Wittenberg, who organised the Lutheran church in northern Germany and Denmark.", "Pastors, church organisers"),
